<section><div class="page-title"><div><h2>Kelola akun</h2><p>Tambahkan rekan kerja untuk mengelola data FleetSync bersama.</p></div><span class="count-tag"><%= accounts.length %> akun</span></div>
<div class="accounts-layout"><div class="table-outer"><div class="table-scroll accounts-table"><table class="data-table"><caption class="sr-only">Akun FleetSync</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">NAMA / USERNAME</th><th scope="col">AKSES</th><th scope="col">DIBUAT</th><th scope="col">AKSI</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for(const account of accounts) { %><tr><td><strong class="operator-name"><%= account.name %><%= String(account.id)===String(user.id)?' (Anda)':'' %></strong><small><%= account.username %></small><% if(account.must_change_password) { %><small>Wajib ganti password</small><% } %></td><td class="account-role"><%= account.is_admin?'Administrator':ROLE %><small><%= account.is_admin||account.can_edit_data?'Bisa edit data':'Lihat saja' %></small></td><td class="date-cell"><%= dateId(new Date(account.created_at).toISOString().slice(0,10)) %></td><td><div class="account-actions"><% if(user.is_admin) { %><a class="subtle-button" href="<%= url('account-edit',{id:account.id}) %>" aria-label="Edit profil dan role <%= account.name %>">Edit profil &amp; role</a><% if(String(account.id)!==String(user.id)) { %><a class="subtle-button" href="<%= url('account-reset',{id:account.id}) %>" aria-label="Reset password <%= account.name %>">Reset password</a><% } %><% } else if(String(account.id)===String(user.id)) { %><a class="subtle-button" href="<%= url('profile') %>">Edit profil</a><% } else { %>-<% } %></div></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><p class="account-note">Semua akun dapat melihat dan mengekspor data. Tambah, edit, hapus, serta impor data dibatasi sesuai izin akun. Edit profil/role akun lain dan reset password hanya tersedia untuk administrator.</p></div>
<form class="editor-form" method="post" action="<%= url('account-create') %>" data-saving><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><h3>Buat akun baru</h3><p class="form-intro">Siapkan identitas dan password untuk rekan kerja.</p><div class="form-grid">
<label class="full-span">Nama lengkap<input name="name" autocomplete="off" required maxlength="120" value="<%= values.name || '' %>"></label><label class="full-span">Username<input name="username" autocomplete="off" required minlength="3" maxlength="80" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9_.\-]{3,80}" value="<%= values.username || '' %>"><small>Huruf, angka, titik, garis bawah, atau tanda hubung.</small></label>
<label>Password akun baru<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="10" maxlength="72"><small>Minimal 10 karakter.</small></label><label>Ulangi password baru<input type="password" name="password_confirmation" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="10" maxlength="72"></label><label class="full-span verification-field">Password Anda<input type="password" name="current_password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="128"><small>Konfirmasi bahwa Anda yang membuat akun ini.</small></label></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Buat akun Pengelola</button></div></form></div></section>
